<% content_for :title,@transporter.display_name %><div class="breadcrumbs"><%= link_to '搬运员名录',transporters_path %><span>/</span><span>勘探档案</span></div><section class="group-heading"><span class="person-initial large"><%= @transporter.display_name.first %></span><div><h1><%= @transporter.display_name %></h1><span class="transporter-title"><%= @transporter.title %></span><p>仅展示公开别名，不关联网站账号或真实 QQ 身份。</p></div></section><div class="metric-strip"><div><b><%= @transporter.natural_count %></b><span>自然搬运</span></div><div><b><%= @transporter.candidate_count %></b><span>候选样本</span></div><div><b><%= @transporter.accepted_count %></b><span>成功建档</span></div><div><b><%= @transporter.classic_count %></b><span>发现典藏</span></div><div><b><%= rate(@transporter.reputation_score) %></b><span>平滑后的信誉</span></div></div><div class="privacy-note">新搬运者从中性信誉开始。信誉只修正模糊情况，一次成功不会变成“神级搬运员”。</div><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>搬运代表作</h2></div><div class="shelf-grid"><%= render partial:'shared/entry_card',collection:@entries,as: :entry %></div><%= empty_state if @entries.empty? %></section><section class="section"><h2>最近留下的脚印</h2><% @occurrences.each do |occurrence| %><div class="occurrence-row"><span class="mono muted"><%= museum_date(occurrence.occurred_at) %></span><%= link_to occurrence.shit_entry.display_title,entry_path(occurrence.shit_entry) %><%= group_link(occurrence.group) %></div><% end %></section>
